{"id":"vi_ctima","lemma":"víctima","pos":"noun","rank":710,"glosses":["victim"],"ipa":"/ˈbiɡtima/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"víctimas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/36/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-v%C3%ADctima.wav","formAudio":{"víctimas":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f0/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Precision27-v%C3%ADctimas.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Ella no es la víctima.","en":"She is not the victim.","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"La víctima fui yo.","en":"I was the victim.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/604626","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},{"g":"I"}]},{"text":"Todavía no se conoce el número de víctimas.","en":"The number of casualties is still unknown.","words":[{"g":"still, yet"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to know","l":"conocer"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"number"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"La primera víctima de la guerra es la verdad.","en":"The first victim of war is truth.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"first gear"},null,null,null,{"g":"war, warfare"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"of the"],[7,9,"honestly, to be honest"]]},{"text":"Quiero examinar el cuerpo de la víctima.","en":"I want to examine the body of the victim.","words":[{"g":"to desire","l":"querer"},{"g":"to examine"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"body"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[4,6,"of the"]]}]}